    "summary": "=============================================================================================================================\nLayer (type:depth-idx)                             Input Shape               Output Shape              Param #\n=============================================================================================================================\nHead                                               [2, 384]                  [2, 47]                   --\n\u251c\u2500GaussianNoise: 1-1                               [2, 384]                  [2, 384]                  --\n\u251c\u2500Serial: 1-2                                      [2, 384]                  [2, 781]                  --\n\u2502    \u2514\u2500ModuleList: 2-1                             --                        --                        --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Dense: 3-1                             [2, 384]                  [2, 781]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Sequential: 4-1                   [2, 384]                  [2, 781]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Linear: 5-1                  [2, 384]                  [2, 781]                  300,685\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Norm: 5-2                    [2, 781]                  [2, 781]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500BatchNorm1d: 6-1        [2, 781]                  [2, 781]                  1,562\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Activation: 5-3              [2, 781]                  [2, 781]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500GELU: 6-2               [2, 781]                  [2, 781]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Dropout: 5-4                 [2, 781]                  [2, 781]                  --\n\u251c\u2500Linear: 1-3                                 